    serviceDetails: {
      '01': { lead: 'Regular check-ups and professional hygiene keep your teeth and gums healthy and catch problems early, when they are simplest to treat.', body: ['A routine examination lets your dentist check your teeth, gums, bite and soft tissues, with digital x-rays when needed. We explain what we see and agree a plan with you.', 'A hygiene visit removes the plaque and hardened tartar that brushing cannot, polishes your teeth and leaves your mouth feeling fresh. We also show you how to care for your smile at home.'], points: ['Full examination and oral-cancer screening', 'Scale and polish to remove plaque and tartar', 'Personalised advice on brushing and diet', 'Recommended about every six months'] },
      '02': { lead: 'Safe, professional whitening lifts years of staining from coffee, tea, wine and time, for a brighter, natural-looking smile.', body: ['We use dentist-supervised whitening with custom-made trays, so the gel fits your teeth precisely and your gums are protected. You will see a noticeable change over a couple of weeks of short daily wear.', 'Before whitening we check that your teeth and gums are healthy, so the result is even and comfortable. We match a shade that looks right for you, not artificially white.'], points: ['Custom trays made from impressions of your teeth', 'Gentle, enamel-safe gel', 'Noticeable results in about two weeks', 'Easy to top up at home'] },
      '03': { lead: 'Thin, custom porcelain shells bonded to the front of your teeth to reshape, brighten and perfect your smile.', body: ['Veneers can close small gaps, cover chips, improve the look of slightly crooked teeth and lift the colour, all at once. Each one is crafted to suit your face and the teeth around it.', 'We plan the shape and shade with you first, prepare the teeth gently and fit veneers that look and feel like natural enamel.'], points: ['Hand-finished, natural-looking porcelain', 'Fixes chips, gaps and discolouration', 'Minimal preparation of your own teeth', 'Long-lasting with normal care'] },
      '04': { lead: 'A permanent, natural-looking way to replace missing teeth: a titanium post that acts as a new root, topped with a crown.', body: ['An implant is placed in the jaw, where it fuses with the bone over a few months to give a stable foundation. We then fit a crown, bridge or secured denture on top.', 'Implants look, feel and function like your own teeth, help preserve the jawbone and do not rely on the teeth beside them.'], points: ['Replaces one tooth, several, or anchors a denture', 'Protects jawbone and neighbouring teeth', 'Looks and chews like a natural tooth', 'Planned with 3D imaging for precision'] },
      '05': { lead: 'Straighten your teeth discreetly with a series of clear, removable aligners, with no metal braces.', body: ['A digital scan maps a step-by-step plan, and each set of near-invisible aligners moves your teeth a little closer to the target. You change them every week or two.', 'Because they are removable, you eat, brush and floss as normal, and most people will not notice you are wearing them.'], points: ['Clear, removable and comfortable', 'See your predicted result before you start', 'Fewer visits than fixed braces', 'Great for mild to moderate crowding or gaps'] },
      '06': { lead: 'Restore damaged or missing teeth with crowns that cap a tooth and bridges that fill a gap.', body: ['A crown covers and protects a tooth that is cracked, worn or heavily filled, restoring its shape and strength. A bridge replaces one or more missing teeth by anchoring to the teeth either side.', 'Both are colour-matched to blend in, so they look like your natural teeth.'], points: ['Protects and rebuilds weakened teeth', 'Fills gaps without surgery', 'Natural, colour-matched materials', 'Custom-made for a precise fit'] },
      '07': { lead: 'A gentle way to save a tooth that is infected or abscessed, relieving pain and keeping your own tooth in place.', body: ['When decay or injury reaches the nerve, we carefully clean the inside of the tooth, disinfect it and seal it, under local anaesthetic so you stay comfortable.', 'Modern root canal treatment is straightforward and relieves the pain of an infection rather than causing it. The tooth is usually crowned afterwards for strength.'], points: ['Saves a tooth that might otherwise be lost', 'Carried out under local anaesthetic', 'Relieves the pain of infection', 'Often finished with a protective crown'] },
      '08': { lead: 'Treatment for bleeding, sore or receding gums, protecting the foundation your teeth depend on.', body: ['Gum (periodontal) disease is common and often painless until it is advanced. We assess the health of your gums, remove the bacteria and tartar below the gumline and help you keep it under control.', 'Our in-house periodontal specialist can treat more advanced cases, helping you keep your natural teeth for longer.'], points: ['Deep cleaning below the gumline', 'Treats bleeding, swelling and bad breath', 'In-house periodontal specialist', 'Tailored home-care plan to keep gums healthy'] },
      '09': { lead: 'Subtle facial aesthetics from clinicians who understand the face, to refresh and soften, naturally.', body: ['Alongside dentistry we offer anti-wrinkle and facial rejuvenation treatments, carried out by trained clinicians in the same relaxed, clinical setting.', 'We take a conservative approach and keep results natural, so you look like a refreshed version of yourself.'], points: ['Anti-wrinkle and facial aesthetics', 'Carried out by trained clinicians', 'Natural, understated results', 'Free consultation to discuss what suits you'] }
    }
